(text "1. One cell is one-sixth of the future 220 A RMS module: about 51.9 A peak with ideal sinusoidal sharing." (at 20 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 0aa02620-7549-5d94-9b1e-5e3b6023f5ac))
(text "2. QH1 / QL1 symbol exposes every package pad: 1 gate; 2,4,6 source; 3,5,7 drain. No separate Kelvin package pin." (at 20 165 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 12f49756-3917-5985-9db5-1b25534272c4))
(text "3. Gate return must take off at the source pad nearest the gate; copper geometry defines Kelvin performance." (at 20 170 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid eac727cb-da22-5e69-afb6-b74b6fb7ec5e))
(text "4. Cold plate contacts the source-connected FET tops through insulating TIM. Driver circuitry is external." (at 20 175 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 679813f5-1dff-5aec-95fc-e49d25b0a6bc))
(text "5. Port pads and driver pads are interface placeholders, not selected/rated connectors. RG values require driver tuning." (at 20 180 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5ec6495f-411e-582e-b09b-298670ea242e))
(text "6. Verify VDS overshoot, capacitance bias/ripple, current sharing, coolant conditions and completed routing before release." (at 20 185 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 0ecad27b-9955-5b9a-b503-7707a129665d))
